 "headline": "\"I saw this on TikTok and I drove 45 minutes to see it!\" - Attendee",
 "intro": "THE GUTS BUS RETURNED TO SUPPORT OLIVIA RODRIGO’S MASSIVE PARTNERSHIP WITH LANCÔME.",
