   "html": "<p>To celebrate the brand’s first major U.S. partnership with Olivia, Lancôme revived the GUTS Tour Bus for a three-week run. It offered fans an immersive brand experience centered around two new products, as well as fan-favorite Juicy Tubes. The bus toured top college campuses and nearby Ulta stores, spreading awareness, facilitating product try-ons, and engaging with the community. Each stop was accompanied with an Olivia merch booth to keep fans connected throughout the journey.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "BUS CREATIVE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The Olivia bus received a full Lancôme-inspired makeover, blending Idôle with Olivia’s GUTS era aesthetic. Both the interior and exterior featured branded elements and key art with the signature rose and touches of pink updates transformed the space. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Highlights included a custom Lancôme rose logo behind the moon bench, a life-size Flutter Mascara, a Juicy Tubes baby tee, and refreshed vanity displays showcasing Idôle Power and Lash Idôle Flutter. The beloved elements from the original GUTS tour maintained the fan-first experience and those direct ties to our star. </p>"
    },
