  {
   "title": "ADDITIONAL ACTIVITIES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Before stepping onto the bus, guests visited our custom push cart to explore Lancôme’s Idôle Power scent and snap photos with a giant 8' fragrance bottle. Brand Ambassadors facilitated product testing, handed out samples, and gifted neon tote bags to the first 100 visitors daily. Fans could also shop at the pop-up merch tent; and the full footprint included custom branded tents and signage to ensure smooth flow and comfort throughout the activation.</p>"
